{"time": 1777015039, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1470423741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "741877128", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[后藤一利【威尔】]使用[乔鲁诺的童年匹配程度。50以上有继父打骂和暴毙黑帮。70以上母亲迁徙改嫁,85以上dio]演奏出:[1D100=74]"}
{"time": 1777015112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123185159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "741877128", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "。rd6 从哪里迁徙来的呢"}
